{
  "slug": "scylladb",
  "name": "Scylladb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Collection of ScyllaDB agent skills for use in agentic workflows. These skills provide coding agents with deep knowledge of ScyllaDB Cloud, ScyllaDB data modeling, and ScyllaDB Vector Search.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `scylladb-alternator` (Guide users building against ScyllaDB's DynamoDB-compatible API (Alternator)), `scylladb-cloud-mcp` (Help users set up and use the ScyllaDB Cloud MCP server to manage ScyllaDB Cloud clusters via AI…), `scylladb-cloud-setup` (Guide users through connecting to a ScyllaDB Cloud cluster, choosing the correct driver and version, and configuring authentication), `scylladb-data-modeling` (ScyllaDB CQL data modeling patterns and anti-patterns), `scylladb-kubernetes` (Guide users deploying and operating ScyllaDB on Kubernetes via the official ScyllaDB Operator), `scylladb-vector-search` (Guides ScyllaDB Cloud users through implementing and optimizing Vector Search for semantic similarity, RAG, and similar use cases)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `scylladb-cloud`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scylladb@claude-community` from `scylladb/agent-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "mcp": 1
  },
